Lianet Magrans created KAFKA-16215:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: Consumer does not rejoin after fenced on delayed revocation
                 Key: KAFKA-16215
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16215
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
          Components: clients, consumer
            Reporter: Lianet Magrans
            Assignee: Lianet Magrans


Consumer with partitions assigned for T1, T1 gets deleted, consumer gets stuck attempting to commit offsets so the reconciliation does not complete. It gets fenced then but is not attempting to rejoin as it should. 



