             Summary: Tsl13SelectorTest::testExpireClosedConnectionWithPendingReceives hangs infinitely
                 Key: KAFKA-16219
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16219
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Test
            Reporter: Gaurav Narula
