Greg Harris created KAFKA-16242:
-----------------------------------

             Summary: Mark flaky tests as integration tests
                 Key: KAFKA-16242
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16242
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Test
          Components: unit tests
            Reporter: Greg Harris
            Assignee: Greg Harris


It would be valuable to have the `unitTest` gradle target run only reliable tests that can be used for CI gating. If we push all of the flaky or possibly-flaky tests to the integrationTest target, we can start gating CI on deterministic failures.



