> >    {
> >      "BaseOffset": 111,
> >      "LastOffset": 118,
> >      "State": 0 (Available),
> >      "DeliveryCount": 0
> >    }
> >
> > 24. "when a broker becomes the leader of a share-partition, it must rea=
d
