> >
> > 26. AlterShareGroupOffsetsResult alterShareGroupOffsets(String groupId,
> > Map<TopicPartition, OffsetAndMetadata> offsets): How is the metadata
> used?
> > It doesn't seem there is an API to use it in either the client
> application
