Justine Olshan resolved KAFKA-16229.
------------------------------------
    Resolution: Fixed

> Slow expiration of Producer IDs leading to high CPU usage
> ---------------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-16229
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16229
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Bug
>            Reporter: Jorge Esteban Quilcate Otoya
>            Assignee: Jorge Esteban Quilcate Otoya
>            Priority: Major
>
> Expiration of ProducerIds is implemented with a slow removal of map keys:
> ```
> =C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0 =C2=A0 producers.keySet().removeAll(keys);
> ```
> Unnecessarily going through all producer ids and then throw all expired k=
eys to be removed.
> This leads to exponential time on worst case when most/all keys need to b=
e removed:
> ```
