Mickael Maison created KAFKA-16246:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: Cleanups in ConsoleConsumer
                 Key: KAFKA-16246
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-16246
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
          Components: tools
            Reporter: Mickael Maison


When rewriting ConsoleConsumer in Java, in order to keep the conversion and review process simple we mimicked the logic flow and types used in the Scala implementation.

Once the rewrite is merged, we should refactor some of the logic to make it more Java-like. This include removing Optional where it makes sense and moving all the argument checking logic into ConsoleConsumerOptions.


See https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/15274 for pointers.

  



