Cf [https://lists.apache.org/thread/f4z1vmpb21xhyxl6966xtcb3958fyx5d]=C2=A0
{quote}For RocksDB stores, we open the store first and then call #register,=
 [...] However the in-memory store actually registers itself *first*, befor=
e marking itself as open,[..].

I suppose it would make sense to align the two store implementations to hav=
e the same behavior, and the in-memory store is probably technically more c=
orrect.
{quote}



