KA%20AND%20text%20~%20%22virtual%20threads%22

We have some reports in the Spring for Apache Kafka project that the virtua=
l threads support is broken with Kafka consumers. See the following two iss=
ues for details:
 # [https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-kafka/issues/3074]
 # [https://github.com/spring-projects/spring-kafka/issues/3013]

