I am using Debezium Informix Source connector and JDBC Sink connector and t=
he below versions of Informix database and KAFKA Connect.

Informix Dynamic Server
14.10.FC10W1X2
Informix JDBC Driver for Informix Dynamic Server
4.50.JC10

KAFKA Version: 7.4.1-ce

=C2=A0

*Expected Behavior:*

All tasks of the Informix source connector are running, and all messages ar=
e being published in the topic. During the DDL Execution, the informix data=
base is put under single user mode and the DDL on the table on which CDC wa=
s previously enabled was executed. After the database exits from the single=
 user mode, then the connector should be able to reconnect with the source =
database and be able to publish messages in the topic for each new event.=
=C2=A0

*Actual Behavior:*

All tasks of the Informix source connector are running, and all messages ar=
e being published in the topic. During the DDL Execution, the database is p=
ut under single user mode and the DDL on the table on which CDC was previou=
sly enabled was executed. After the database exits from the single user mod=
e, the source connector is able to reconnect with the database, however, no=
 messages are being published in the topic and the below error is being pri=
nted in the KAFKA Connect Logs.=C2=A0

=C2=A0

*[2024-02-22 15:54:34,913] WARN [kafka_devs|task-0|offsets] Couldn't commit=
 processed log positions with the source database due to a concurrent conne=
ctor shutdown or restart (io.debezium.connector.common.BaseSourceTask:349)*

=C2=A0

The complete KAFKA Connect logs has been attached. Kindly comment on why th=
is issue is occurring and what steps should be followed to avoid this issue=
 or to resolve this issue.=C2=A0

=C2=A0

Thanks.=C2=A0



