>
> Just a minor comment. Could you document the exact meaning of the followi=
ng
> two metrics? For example, is the time accumulated? If so, is it from the
> start of the broker or over some window?
>
> kafka.log.remote:type=3DRemoteLogManager, name=3DRemoteFetchThrottleTime
> kafka.log.remote:type=3DRemoteLogManager, name=3DRemoteCopyThrottleTime
>
> Jun
